Project: VulnPath-AI — Python hybrid security scanner.

Rules:
- Edit existing files only (analyze_hybrid.py, ast_analyzer.py, test_benchmark.py, README.md, samples/).
- Do not rewrite the whole project.
- Keep report formats: JSON, Markdown, SARIF.
- Keep finding fields: cwe_id, severity, confidence, line, suggestion, impact.
- Fix suggestions only. No attack/exploit features.
- Stdlib-first. Do not add new packages unless asked.
- Never hardcode API keys.
- Small changes. Short # comments only when asked.
- Target: Python AI/agent-app scanner, ~15-20 rules, honest scope.